        <outline description="Free information uncensored... &#xa;&#xa;This channel is not monetized and all videos are not produced by me. Please always support the creators of the videos or BitChute to continue to ensure free expression.&#xa;&#xa;This channel was created to give people a way to find out what kind of channels are out there and also to provide videos that have already been deleted or censored.&#xa;&#xa;Have fun!" encoding="UTF-8" text="FreiheitsFreund" title="FreiheitsFreund" type="rss" version="RSS" xmlUrl="https://api.bitchute.com/feeds/rss/channel/FreiheitsFreund/" rssguard:postProcess="" rssguard:xmlUrlType="0" xmlns:rssguard="https://github.com/martinrotter/rssguard"/>
