        <outline description="A Back up channel to the YouTube channel called &quot;The Fascifist&quot;. Videos especially at risk for being taken down on YouTube are uploaded here. The Fascifist is a host of a podcast show called &quot;America Awake Radio&quot;&#xa;&#xa;Donate or become a Patron here: https://www.patreon.com/AmericaAwakeRadio" encoding="UTF-8" text="TheFascifist" title="TheFascifist" type="rss" version="RSS" xmlUrl="https://api.bitchute.com/feeds/rss/channel/TheFascifist/" rssguard:postProcess="" rssguard:xmlUrlType="0" xmlns:rssguard="https://github.com/martinrotter/rssguard"/>
        <outline description="American Renaissance is a publication founded in 1990 and dedicated to the study of immigration and race relations so as to better understand the consequences of America's increasing diversity, and to speak in the name of the legitimate interests of America's historic majority. It was published as a monthly print magazine until 2012, and has since been produced online. &#xa;&#xa;Find out more at our website: https://www.amren.com/. &#xa;&#xa;Podcast channel: https://www.bitchute.com/channel/PvE9Fgz40IbM/&#xa;Conference channel: https://www.bitchute.com/channel/oXJDii58nHYl/&#xa;&#xa;Gab (American Renaissance): https://gab.ai/AmRenaissance.&#xa;Gab (Jared Taylor): https://gab.com/jartaylor&#xa;&#xa;Parler (American Renaissance): https://parler.com/profile/AmRenaissance/&#xa;Parler (Jared Taylor): https://parler.com/profile/JaredTaylorAmRen/" encoding="UTF-8" text="American Renaissance" title="American Renaissance" type="rss" version="RSS" xmlUrl="https://api.bitchute.com/feeds/rss/channel/amrenaissance/" rssguard:postProcess="" rssguard:xmlUrlType="0" xmlns:rssguard="https://github.com/martinrotter/rssguard"/>
        <outline description="We examine unanswered questions - and questions with dubious answers - of the last century. Our goal is to offer a fresh perspective on topics that still affect the course of events today, and in doing so hopefully offer a counterpoint to the mainstream narrative on history so that we can make more informed decisions going forward.&#xa;&#xa;~~-- Donations: https://www.patreon.com/MYTH20 --~~&#xa;BTC: 16UQ6ukmTjz4Z7Ce4n23bN6tKGnU7XkPeQ&#xa;https://myth20c.wordpress.com/books/&#xa;https://theamericansun.com&#xa;https://twitter.com/myth20c&#xa;https://gab.ai/myth20c" encoding="UTF-8" text="Myth of the 20th Century" title="Myth of the 20th Century" type="rss" version="RSS" xmlUrl="https://api.bitchute.com/feeds/rss/channel/myth20c/" rssguard:postProcess="" rssguard:xmlUrlType="0" xmlns:rssguard="https://github.com/martinrotter/rssguard"/>
