        <outline description="THE TRUTH FEARS NO INVESTIGATION&#xa;&#xa;BANNED IN EU - Use VPN connected to a country outside of the European Union.&#xa;&#xa;SHOULD MY CHANNEL GET CENSORED, OR ANY OF MY VIDEOS, DOES THIS NOT PROVE THE POINT OF MY CHANNELS EXISTENCE?&#xa;&#xa;If you expose, or propose, alternative information to critical subjects in our day and age, you're probably going to get censored. With this channel, I intend to hopefully share information that may inform and start new thought processes in people around the world.&#xa;&#xa;No hate is intended, this is HISTORY, take it or leave it. Draw your own conclusions. That is the viewers job, not the videos.&#xa;&#xa;I DO NOT own any videos, audio tracks (music and effects), and all other data included in any of the videos uploaded to this channel.&#xa;&#xa;I ONLY edited video tracks, audio tracks and various effects together and added subtitles, etc. Some videos I did not even edit, I simply archived them here on my channel for public use. I'm hopeful the original editors (many of them unknown to me) of these videos, would be happy about that.&#xa;&#xa;I DO NOT EARN ANY MONEY from any content uploaded to this channel.&#xa;&#xa;All rights of any videos posted belongs each to their rightful, respective owners. I DO NOT claim ownership of any content.&#xa;&#xa;Thanks for your support!" encoding="UTF-8" text="Censored History (BANNED IN EU - Use VPN)" title="Censored History (BANNED IN EU - Use VPN)" type="rss" version="RSS" xmlUrl="https://api.bitchute.com/feeds/rss/channel/Censored_History/" rssguard:postProcess="" rssguard:xmlUrlType="0" xmlns:rssguard="https://github.com/martinrotter/rssguard"/>
